From affa6a42bfaaef2aec5bd3abfd748186a5d2fe80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:01:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] board: mediatek: Add Advan X1 (MT6789) board support

Add board support, device tree, configuration header, MAINTAINERS, and
defconfig for the Advan X1 smartphone (MediaTek MT6789 / Helio G99).

board_fix_fdt() queries DISP_OVL0 Layer 0 to locate the active
pre-initialized DSI framebuffer, clears any prior-stage overlay planes
to alpha=0, and patches simple-framebuffer reg in-place before DM video
probes. board_late_init() initializes video and probes UFS/SCSI storage
for FIT / bootstd / Fastboot boot.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
